            For most homes, the Anker Prime Charger 200W is the best charging station to buy: six ports, 100W from any USB-C port, and enough total power for two laptops and the phones next to them. Add the Belkin UltraCharge Pro Qi2 dock on the nightstand if you live in Apple's ecosystem, and the Satechi Dock5 on the kitchen counter if the family's phones and tablets need a home. On a budget, the UGREEN Nexode 100W or the Anker 7-in-1 charging block covers one laptop and accessories for very little.
          </p>
